      "note": "Planning factor: beam time on target = azimuth beamwidth / scan rate (Skolnik; Wikipedia 'Dwell time (radar)'). Saab gives 60 rpm (360°/s, search volume every second). Saab publishes no beamwidth; a 2° X-band beam (about 1 m aperture) is assumed. 2° / 360°/s = 5.6 ms. Saab publishes no dwell."
